          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netuambe tshinyi bua malu â? Bikala Nzambi nʼetu, nganyi udi mumanye mua kutuhumbisha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye kakimina Muana wandi mene, kadi wakamufila bua buonso buetu, munyi muahidieye kutuha nʼandi kabidi bintu bionso hatuhu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi mua kubanda basungudibue kudi Nzambi nganyi? Udi ubabingisha nNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi ubahisha nganyi? NKilisto Yesu mene wakafua, E, bulelela, wakabishibua ku lufu, udi ku tshianza tshikole tshia Nzambi, udi utuakuila kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udi mua kutuhandulula ku dinanga dia Kilisto nganyi? Ntatu idi mua kuenza nunka, anyi kanyinganyinga, anyi tshinyangu, anyi tshiole, anyi butaka, anyi njû, anyi muele wa nvita? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbu muakafundabo ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
